<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in the San Francisco Bay Area</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for five premium cabinetry brands — Eclipse, Pronorm German Kitchens, Shiloh, Aspect, and Vistora Closets — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers across the Bay Area.</p></div>
<div class="content-narrow section">
<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in the Bay Area</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in the Bay Area, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value to handleless German luxury — backed by 23+ years of hands-on dealer support. From San Francisco and Marin to the Peninsula — Palo Alto, Atherton, Los Altos — and the East Bay's Walnut Creek, Lafayette, and Orinda, the Bay Area leans clean and contemporary, with strong demand for frameless and European cabinetry. We offer protected territory, line training, and the design and merchandising help your team needs to win high-end contemporary projects.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access — a natural fit for the Bay Area's contemporary aesthetic, with strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless European fronts for high-end Peninsula, Marin, and East Bay homes, with protected territory.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint and <a href="/playbook/modern-inset">inset</a> for transitional and craftsman remodels.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Semi-custom value for ADUs and multi-unit projects.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="bay-area-market-opportunity">The Bay Area Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>Bay Area kitchens favor clean, contemporary design — flat-panel and slab fronts, warm woods against white and gray, and integrated, minimalist detailing. The tech-driven Peninsula and Silicon Valley markets push toward seamless <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> and handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> kitchens, while Marin, the East Bay, and San Francisco's many period homes balance modern function with transitional warmth — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the European and full-access lines that fit the region.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs Bay Area dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

